WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.554 --> 00:00:07.017
- What you're gonna see behind me

00:00:07.017 --> 00:00:08.712
is a gauntlet of superstitions.

00:00:08.712 --> 00:00:11.393
It doesn't really matter
how superstitious I am

00:00:11.393 --> 00:00:14.544
because this is all gonna
be enough to ruin my life.

00:00:14.544 --> 00:00:16.675
- The mirror is the one
that I'm like, "Oooo."

00:00:16.675 --> 00:00:17.807
- And I know what this is about.

00:00:17.807 --> 00:00:19.385
This means I'm not gonna get married.

00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:21.022
There will never be a ring on this finger.

00:00:21.022 --> 00:00:22.404
- This is so stupid.

00:00:22.404 --> 00:00:24.529
- My cat's probably gonna
be dead when I come home.

00:00:24.529 --> 00:00:26.246
My girlfriend's gonna break up with me.

00:00:26.246 --> 00:00:28.012
I'm gonna lose my job,
what else can happen?

00:00:31.582 --> 00:00:34.272
It's a very common
condiment in the household

00:00:34.272 --> 00:00:37.197
and I'm just gonna pour
one out for my homies.

00:00:37.197 --> 00:00:38.335
- You know why this is probably bad luck

00:00:38.335 --> 00:00:39.670
because it's wasteful, that's why.

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:41.624
- Fuck you salt. There it is.

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:42.886
- Not gonna throw it over my shoulder

00:00:42.886 --> 00:00:46.275
because that would be the
common sense thing to do.

00:00:46.275 --> 00:00:49.190
- [voiceover] No! No, Curly.

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:49.886
- I don't care.

00:00:49.886 --> 00:00:51.210
You're not the one that's
gonna die and lose their hair.

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:52.474
- So we've got an umbrella.

00:00:52.474 --> 00:00:54.449
- Umbrella is the one that
I think I'm least afraid of

00:00:54.449 --> 00:00:56.612
because I don't believe in
umbrellas, I believe in Jesus.

00:00:56.612 --> 00:00:57.989
- This one ain't messing me up too bad,

00:00:57.989 --> 00:00:58.965
I'm feeling good about this.

00:00:58.965 --> 00:01:00.920
The salt thing I'm not
feeling awesome about though.

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:02.389
I really wanna toss that.

00:01:03.489 --> 00:01:04.633
- Okay.

00:01:08.507 --> 00:01:11.153
I've avoided walking
under ladders all my life.

00:01:11.153 --> 00:01:12.385
And there's like a million of them.

00:01:12.385 --> 00:01:13.893
- I don't wanna do this.

00:01:13.893 --> 00:01:18.792
- (laughing) Oh, man. All right.

00:01:18.792 --> 00:01:20.987
- We're just gonna calmly
stroll through the ladders.

00:01:20.987 --> 00:01:23.610
- Bye, future. It was nice knowing you.

00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:24.831
- Well, I would have to say that this

00:01:24.831 --> 00:01:27.232
is probably just dangerous overall.

00:01:27.232 --> 00:01:28.892
- Does this mean I'm
gonna have eight husbands?

00:01:28.892 --> 00:01:31.005
- Just hanging underneath
all these ladders.

00:01:31.005 --> 00:01:32.967
- ♫ I made it.

00:01:36.987 --> 00:01:38.749
- And here we are reflection.

00:01:38.749 --> 00:01:39.828
- What are the goggles for?

00:01:39.828 --> 00:01:41.314
What's gonna protect the rest of me?

00:01:41.314 --> 00:01:43.009
What's gonna protect
my spirit and my soul?

00:01:43.009 --> 00:01:44.994
- Going out with my
boots on and my shirt off

00:01:44.994 --> 00:01:47.014
like a true redneck, how we're doing this.

00:01:48.744 --> 00:01:49.467
- Why?

00:01:49.467 --> 00:01:51.856
- (laughing) I don't wanna do this.

00:01:51.856 --> 00:01:53.890
- If my life is gonna
suck from here on out

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:55.573
this is my aggression to the thing

00:01:55.573 --> 00:01:56.758
that's gonna fuck up my life.

00:01:56.758 --> 00:02:01.139
- ♫ Oh, sweet lord be with me today.

00:02:02.489 --> 00:02:03.859
- Oh.

00:02:05.489 --> 00:02:07.420
- (screaming)
(glass shattering)

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:11.401
Fuck my life, that was so
cool, but I'm so scared.

00:02:11.401 --> 00:02:12.933
Why do I still have these goggles on?

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:16.927
- Not too shabby, I guess.
(glass breaking)

00:02:16.927 --> 00:02:19.778
I just feel like this is
just gonna fly on me though.

00:02:19.778 --> 00:02:21.315
(glass shattering)

00:02:21.315 --> 00:02:22.987
Today, the angels and whoever is up there

00:02:22.987 --> 00:02:24.496
is gonna have to be working extra hard.

00:02:24.496 --> 00:02:26.249
We'll see if I'm still alive later on.

00:02:28.969 --> 00:02:30.364
(glass shattering)

00:02:34.104 --> 00:02:35.664
- Oh shit.

00:02:39.547 --> 00:02:40.695
- [voiceover] How was your week?

00:02:40.695 --> 00:02:42.554
- Feel like I had an
exceptionally good week.

00:02:42.554 --> 00:02:44.285
- The week went by pretty smoothly.

00:02:44.285 --> 00:02:45.873
- I'm definitely glad about the experience

00:02:45.873 --> 00:02:47.697
because I feel like it
helped me take power away

00:02:47.697 --> 00:02:49.345
from those things in a sense.

00:02:49.345 --> 00:02:51.226
- When you think something
positive is gonna happen

00:02:51.226 --> 00:02:52.886
you make it happen for yourself.

00:02:52.886 --> 00:02:53.710
- At the end of the day

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:55.114
it's just the way that you view things.

00:02:55.114 --> 00:02:56.844
If somebody were to tell you that

00:02:56.844 --> 00:02:58.992
if you actually break a
mirror that's good luck

00:02:58.992 --> 00:03:01.151
then you're gonna believe
that it's gonna be good luck

00:03:01.151 --> 00:03:03.612
and it's gonna change the
way that you live your life

00:03:03.612 --> 00:03:04.761
on a daily I think.

00:03:04.761 --> 00:03:06.978
(somber piano)

00:03:14.468 --> 00:03:17.044
- I really think this broke
a lot of barriers for me.

00:03:17.044 --> 00:03:20.771
I did everything I could
to make my luck awful

00:03:20.771 --> 00:03:23.069
and this week was actually pretty good.

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:24.752
- Now, if it was mercury retro-grade,

00:03:24.752 --> 00:03:26.470
then that'd be a different story.

00:03:26.470 --> 00:03:28.003
Then, I'd be like, "Fuh."

00:03:28.003 --> 00:03:29.083
I would never break another mirror again

00:03:29.083 --> 00:03:30.699
because maybe bad luck was like, "Oh shit,

00:03:30.699 --> 00:03:32.714
they're filming us. I won't
be showing up this round."

